verdicts.note:
Present: underline styles and colour, 16 ANSI (Theme.ansi) plus truecolor (resolved Rgb), wide characters, strike.
The producer resolves:
- reverse (swap);
- faint (blend, as ghostel does);
- invisible (space);
- text blink, which ghostel doesn't render either.
Missing:
- overline;
- link id (planned for M2);
- an underline cursor and cursor blink;
- the cell frame Surface::render should write into.
Non-breaking: enum variants (the compiler guides the migration, C12) and new Scene fields. Breaking: new Cell fields, unless there are attribute flags and a constructor (scene-7).
